### 2. Plan

1) Retrieve the IPO prospectus document(s) from the provided reference set using retriever_agent; request full text and identify sections/pages that mention "Adjusted EBITDA", "EBITDA", "Non-GAAP measures", "reconciliation", and any pro forma financial statements.

